# Dolos .gitignore

## Project-local documentation (not tracked)
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md
PLAN.md

## Dev docs (local Mythic reference cache)
dev_docs/

## Read-only reference code (never tracked)
reference_code/

## Dev artifacts
install_test*.txt
*.log
screenshots/
!assets/screenshots/

## Dev tooling
mythic-mcp-conf.json
.mcp.json
.claude/

## Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

## OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

## Secrets
.env

## Local debug config (gitignored - use template)
rabbitmq_config.local.json

## Jupyter notebooks (testing only)
*.ipynb

## Root-level dev files (removed)
/encoder_v2.py
/shellcode_test.py
.venv/
dev_examples/

## RabbitMQ config (generated at runtime by mythic-cli, contains passwords)
Payload_Type/dolos/rabbitmq_config.json
Payload_Type/dolos/rabbitmq_config.local.json

## Dev planning docs (not shipped to users)
docs/*.code-workspace
